WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.469
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind computer parts around us.

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:10.763
Monitor: shows words and pictures. Keyboard: enters letters and numbers.

00:00:11.617 --> 00:00:16.714
Mouse: moves and selects a pointer. System unit: contains important computing

00:00:16.714 --> 00:00:19.958
components. Speakers: play sound from a computer.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:25.820
In a small group, draw or safely examine pictures of monitor, keyboard and mouse.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:28.698
Explain one real-life use for each in Ghana.
